<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<table xml:id="table-concept-dictionary" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Concept Dictionary</title>

  <tabular>

    <col width = "20%"/>
    <col width = "40%"/>
    <col width = "40%"/>

    <row header="yes">
      <cell>Concept</cell>
      <cell>Mathematical expression</cell>
      <cell>Meaning</cell>
    </row>

   <row>
     <cell>
       <p>A vector has coordinate components</p>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <m>\mathbf{v}=v_q\mathbf{e}_q+v_p\mathbf{e}_p</m>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <p>A direction can be decomposed into <m>q</m> and <m>p</m> coordinates.</p>
     </cell>
   </row>

   <row>
     <cell>
       <p>A 1-form measures a vector</p>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <m>dq(\mathbf{v})=v_q</m>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <p><m>dq</m> extracts the <m>q</m> component.</p>
     </cell>
   </row>

   <row>
     <cell>
       <p>Finish creating this table using the attached image in the CONVENTION_STITCHING folder</p>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <m></m>
     </cell>
     <cell>
       <p></p>
     </cell>
   </row>


  </tabular>

</table>